  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Akh-Iddaran Market Garden Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project, the cooperative seeks to build its capacity to organize operations and find better markets for its producers. Members will benefit from the construction of eight market garden wells and procurement of ten motor pumps to improve access to water and technical training to increase production. Members will sell their tomatoes and other crops through the cooperative to access larger, more lucrative markets and reduce transportation costs and post-harvest losses, resulting in increased production and incomes to members.</narrative>
  </description>
